tags: device-models

A fact of a start: the model of each device that the node attached to the instance at
this start.

The value is key=value lines, sorted by the bytes of the key, separated by a newline.
The key is the position of the entry of Container.devices, in base 10. The value is the
model: "pci:" and the value of the fact pci-model (0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:f77f111c3a3c9e36622b21845ab2e344fafb2b47f10ae9854b4d58649b751c28), or "usb:"
and the value of the fact usb-model (0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:b694a23c7e6ec4cb9f5678669a07835bf75753333db179f2ee8f518da62dfec3). Example:
0=pci:10de:2330. An entry with no device at the start has no line.

An absent fact: the node attests no model. The node is bound: it signs the receipt.

=== formal
class=fact
name=device-models
pci=0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:f77f111c3a3c9e36622b21845ab2e344fafb2b47f10ae9854b4d58649b751c28
place=StartReceipt.facts
usb=0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:b694a23c7e6ec4cb9f5678669a07835bf75753333db179f2ee8f518da62dfec3
value=key=value lines sorted by key; the key is the position of the entry of Container.devices in base 10; the value is pci:<value of the fact pci-model> or usb:<value of the fact usb-model>
